Cell["\<\
Input: Circuit in DFD format.

Renders the circuit, exports a PNG, and copies the JSON to the clipboard.

Note: This setup drops the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]$schema\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] property from the JSON.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d52aba86-7285-41a4-bbe2-1d3979209fea"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Import", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"576a1ef6-94c4-47e4-92d7-5bfd71372ef4"],

